        "category": "evieve",
        "digest": "Reimplementation of MSP <o>line~</o> but with an embedded 'S-curve'",
        "description": "evi_sline is similar to MSP <o>line~</o> (without list processing of course) and evi_line, providing exact ramp destination time but with an 'S-curve' output ramp. Because the destination time is exact, this can be used for CPU management (as it is often in the evieve package)."
